		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>No Action Cost</strong></p><p><em>Trigger: You use <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.Gm7eVG59Om6KG3aM]{Vicious Mockery}</em> and your target fails their save or you deal damage with @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.f71fyym4jcBrftdZ]{Jester's Aspersion}.</em></p><ul><li><p>You can choose to &amp;reference[charmed]{charm} the creature until you damage them or until the end of your next turn. Note that this charm does not protect your allies from the target.</p></li></ul>",
